<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="ie=edge">
    <title>Inderjeet Academy - Coaching Classes</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f0f8ff;
            color: #333;
        }
        header {
            background-color: #16a085;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px 0;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        header h1 {
            margin: 10px 0;
            font-size: 36px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        header img {
            width: 120px;
            height: auto;
            margin: 0 auto;
            border-radius: 50%;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
        }
        .content {
            padding: 30px 15px;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .content h2 {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 30px;
            color: #34495e;
        }
        .content p {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 10px 0 20px;
            font-size: 18px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .subjects {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
        .subject-card {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border: 2px solid #ecf0f1;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 20px;
            width: 250px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }
        .subject-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
        }
        .subject-card h2 {
            color: #2c3e50;
            font-size: 22px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .subject-card p {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #7f8c8d;
        }
        footer {
            background-color: #16a085;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 15px 0;
            position: fixed;
            width: 100%;
            bottom: 0;
            box-shadow: 0 -2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        .contact-info {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        .contact-info p {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #34495e;
        }
        .contact-info a {
            color: #e74c3c;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .contact-info a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <img src="your-logo-path.jpg" alt="Inderjeet Academy Logo"> 
    <h1>Inderjeet Academy</h1>
    <p>Coaching Classes for Class 8, 9 & 10 - State Board</p>
</header>

<div class="content">
    <h2>Welcome to Inderjeet Academy</h2>
    <p>We offer comprehensive coaching for students in Thane West, Maharashtra, focusing on all subjects for the State Board. Our expert teachers are dedicated to helping students achieve academic excellence.</p>

    <div class="subjects">
        <div class="subject-card">
            <h2>Mathematics</h2>
            <p>Comprehensive lessons and practice to help students master concepts.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="subject-card">
            <h2>Science</h2>
            <p>In-depth understanding of Physics, Chemistry, and Biology.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="subject-card">
            <h2>English</h2>
            <p>Building language skills and understanding literature.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="subject-card">
            <h2>Social Studies</h2>
            <p>Understanding history, geography, and civics for better grades.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="subject-card">
            <h2>Sanskrit</h2>
            <p>Learn the ancient language with a focus on grammar and literature.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="subject-card">
            <h2>Marathi</h2>
            <p>Strengthening your understanding of Marathi language and literature.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="subject-card">
            <h2>Hindi</h2>
            <p>Learning Hindi grammar, literature, and communication skills.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="subject-card">
            <h2>German</h2>
            <p>Learn German language basics and grammar with interactive lessons.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="contact-info">
        <p>For admissions, please contact: 7045559363</p>
        <p><a href="tel:+917045559363">+91 7045559363</a> | <a href="tel:+919867379335">+91 9867379335</a></p>
    </div>
</div>

<footer>
    <p>&copy; 2025 Inderjeet Academy. All Rights Reserved.</p>
</footer>

